The contract implements a voting system but contains a critical access control flaw in application deletion.

### Vulnerability: Arbitrary Delete
### Explanation: The contract unconditionally allows ANY user to delete the application by returning `Int(1)` in the `OnComplete.DeleteApplication` handler, allowing permanent destruction of the contract and its voting data without authorization checks.
### Risk: Critical - Allows complete and irreversible destruction of the voting application and all associated data by any malicious actor.
